{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/2009/xoxo-creativity/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"CodeSpud","author":"@codespud"}},"related":{"nodes":[{"fields":{"slug":"/2019/how-to-use-custom-domains-to-github-pages/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"How to Use Custom Domains with Github Pages","date":"22 April 2019","isoDate":"2019-04-22","tags":["website","blogging"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2014/quick-and-free-way-to-set-up-your-app-using-heroku/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Quick and Free Way to Set Up Your App using Heroku","date":"20 April 2014","isoDate":"2014-04-20","tags":["website","devops"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/bit-ly-a-simple-url-shortener/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Bit.ly, A Simple URL Shortener","date":"17 October 2009","isoDate":"2009-10-17","tags":["utility","website"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/what-browser/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"What Browser?","date":"10 October 2009","isoDate":"2009-10-10","tags":["browser","website"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/funny-video-animator-vs-animated/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Funny Video: Animator vs Animated","date":"8 October 2009","isoDate":"2009-10-08","tags":["fun","animation","video"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/ocr-api-on-google-docsnot-yet/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"OCR API on Google Docs(not yet)","date":"30 September 2009","isoDate":"2009-09-30","tags":["website","google","api"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/project-10100-the-voting-begins/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Project 10^100: The Voting Begins","date":"25 September 2009","isoDate":"2009-09-25","tags":["website","google"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/picasa-3-5-comes-with-face-recognition/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Picasa 3.5 comes with Face Recognition","date":"24 September 2009","isoDate":"2009-09-24","tags":["google","website","images"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/nes-on-javascript/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"NES on Javascript","date":"21 September 2009","isoDate":"2009-09-21","tags":["game","javascript","website","fun"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/resume-on-youtube/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Resume on Youtube!","date":"19 September 2009","isoDate":"2009-09-19","tags":["website","video"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/m-i-stupid/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"M I STUPID?","date":"19 September 2009","isoDate":"2009-09-19","tags":["website","fun"]}}]},"markdownRemark":{"id":"6b9764fd-3959-58c0-a9ad-cdfd7a539178","excerpt":"Here’s a good way to promote creativity and have fun at the same time. The rule is to draw as many things as your imagination can conjure up from X’s and O’s.","html":"<p>Here’s a good way to promote creativity and have fun at the same time. The rule is to draw as many things as your imagination can conjure up from X’s and O’s.</p>\n<!--more-->\n<div style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n  <a href=\"http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_BBS5bkzuLXM/SrYMrUXkywI/AAAAAAAAChE/-eiXrZLTvAk/s1600-h/crea7128934724tivity11.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_BBS5bkzuLXM/SrYMrUXkywI/AAAAAAAAChE/-eiXrZLTvAk/s400/crea7128934724tivity11.jpg\"></a><br>Almost done.\n</div>\n<p><a name='more'></a>This is what <strong>Panamericana School of Art and Design</strong> did in a advertising campaign.I tried googling for their site but can’t seem to find it. Anyway I’ll update this page when I get more info.</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n  <a href=\"http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_BBS5bkzuLXM/SrYM7xiv9pI/AAAAAAAAChM/kgBpufSfVeo/s1600-h/creativityasdad12.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_BBS5bkzuLXM/SrYM7xiv9pI/AAAAAAAAChM/kgBpufSfVeo/s400/creativityasdad12.jpg\"></a><br>There’s something naughty in this shot.\n</div>\n<p>I made my own versions to work with. You can download them below. Try them out with your kids and friends. You might just be surprised what plays in their minds. 🙂  Everybody say <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rorschach_test\">Rorschach test</a>! :D.</p>\n<p><em>Credit to Panamericana for the idea.</em><br>\n<em>Images from <a href=\"http://www.toxel.com/inspiration/2009/05/06/school-of-art-and-design-creativity-test/\">www.toxel.com</a></em></p>\n<p>O’s Creativity Test <a href=\"http://dl.getdropbox.com/u/1510515/potatokorner/potatokorner-O-creativity-test.pdf\">DOWNLOAD</a><br>\nX’s Creativity Test <a href=\"http://dl.getdropbox.com/u/1510515/potatokorner/potatokorner-X-creativity-test.pdf\">DOWNLOAD</a></p>","timeToRead":1,"fields":{"slug":"/2009/xoxo-creativity/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"XOXO Creativity","date":"September 20, 2009","longDate":"20 September 2009","isoDate":"2009-09-20","tags":["website","fun"],"featured_image":null,"featured_image_attribution":null,"contentType":null}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/2009/xoxo-creativity/","tags":["website","fun"]}},"staticQueryHashes":["43041287","764694655"],"slicesMap":{}}